answer-not-a-story-number guards; wpFrames (4Q): one number sentence a step.
Kit: two-step x / / story grammar, frames layout, chart panel parts, Guided
trace of the Step 1 sign, fact division without working rows. Provider steps
and two-step wrong answers; case tests ms*; P5 eqSteps; story-steps string.

